# npm lockfile - the project uses Bun, so package-lock.json would go stale.
#
# Note what this does NOT say. No Bun lockfile is committed either: bun.lock
# and bun.lockb are absent at the repository root and at sites/world, and
# neither is listed here, so they were never committed rather than excluded.
# Until one is committed, every install resolves the version ranges in
# package.json fresh, and two builds of the same commit can install different
# dependency versions. Do not read the line below as evidence of a pin.
package-lock.json

